WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:01.953
- So today we told a
group of our co-workers

00:00:01.953 --> 00:00:04.682
that they were coming in to
test a new iPhone video game.

00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:05.872
But we lied to them.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:07.206
We just scared the (bleep) outta them.

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.077
And we captured it

00:00:08.077 --> 00:00:10.225
in super slow motion.

00:00:10.225 --> 00:00:13.609
(lively swing music)

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.149
- Oh okay, I get it (laughing).

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:20.589
- Okay, well the first
level wasn't so hard.

00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:21.777
- Why do you keep resetting?

00:00:21.777 --> 00:00:23.172
- (grunts) Yeah!

00:00:23.172 --> 00:00:24.681
(screams)

00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:25.550
What the (bleep)?

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.713
Why would you do that?

00:00:26.713 --> 00:00:30.677
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:44.697
(music increases tempo)

00:00:56.491 --> 00:00:57.100
- Damn it!

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.899
I thought I was actually getting it well

00:00:58.899 --> 00:01:00.352
and I was getting it done

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:01.453
and I was like ooh!

00:01:01.453 --> 00:01:03.485
Everyone else had a really tough time.

00:01:03.485 --> 00:01:04.792
And then you guys did that to me.

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:05.636
Thanks guys.

00:01:05.636 --> 00:01:06.734
Really appreciate it.

